---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Templates | Aging at Home Lab" description="Printable caregiver checklists, planning tools, and aging-in-place templates.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Templates</p>
      <h1>Printable tools for safer, more organized care.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Simple worksheets and checklists for families who need to organize care information, home-safety tasks, appointments, contacts, and family responsibilities quickly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-grid" aria-label="Template library">
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Printable</span><span class="badge warning-badge">draft</span></div>
      <h3><a href="/templates/aging-at-home-master-checklist/">Aging at Home Master Checklist</a></h3>
      <p>A first-pass room-by-room checklist for home safety, emergency readiness, and caregiver organization.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Printable</span><span class="badge warning-badge">draft</span></div>
      <h3><a href="/templates/medication-list-template/">Medication List Template</a></h3>
      <p>A worksheet for medication name, dose, schedule, prescriber, pharmacy, allergies, and questions for a clinician or pharmacist.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Printable</span><span class="badge warning-badge">draft</span></div>
      <h3><a href="/templates/emergency-contact-sheet/">Emergency Contact Sheet</a></h3>
      <p>A quick-reference sheet for family contacts, doctors, pharmacy, hospital, home access notes, and local helpers.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Printable</span><span class="badge warning-badge">draft</span></div>
      <h3><a href="/templates/appointment-notes-template/">Doctor Appointment Notes Template</a></h3>
      <p>A planning sheet for questions, visit notes, medication changes, follow-up tasks, and next appointments.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Printable</span><span class="badge warning-badge">draft</span></div>
      <h3><a href="/templates/family-responsibilities-worksheet/">Family Responsibilities Worksheet</a></h3>
      <p>A worksheet for assigning caregiver tasks, backups, frequency, and next check-in topics.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="callout">
    <h2>Template library status</h2>
    <p>These are draft public templates intended for organization and planning. Sensitive health, medication, legal, or safety decisions should be reviewed with qualified professionals.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
